WEBVTT

00:03:29.051 --> 00:03:30.932
(Laughter) --

00:03:30.956 --> 00:03:33.110
all domestic tasks,

00:03:33.134 --> 00:03:37.443
but also: bug killing, trash removal,
lawn care and vehicle maintenance.

00:03:38.014 --> 00:03:39.881
I want no part of any of that.

00:03:39.905 --> 00:03:40.978
(Laughter)

00:03:41.002 --> 00:03:42.899
Pink is my favorite color.

00:03:42.923 --> 00:03:45.951
I enjoy fashion magazines
and pretty things.

00:03:45.975 --> 00:03:48.278
I watch "The Bachelor"
and romantic comedies,

00:03:48.302 --> 00:03:51.409
and I have absurd fantasies
about fairy tales coming true.

00:03:52.121 --> 00:03:54.445
Some of my transgressions
are more flagrant.

00:03:54.914 --> 00:03:57.280
If a woman wants to take
her husband's name,

00:03:57.304 --> 00:03:59.992
that is her choice, and it is not
my place to judge.